<includeonly>{{#invoke:CinderData|itemTable|tab={{{tab|}}}}}</includeonly><noinclude>
A sortable table of every item in one creative tab. Columns appear only when at least one item has that stat. Each row is a link target, so /wiki/<item id> jumps straight to its row.

Usage: <code><nowiki>{{ItemTable|tab=cinderblocks}}</nowiki></code>

The bot adds this to new pages. You do not need to change it; write your text around it. The data is read from the <code>Data:</code> pages and drawn by [[Module:CinderData]].

